{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"78bc9971805314997ff4566e48478a49f397d7d15fa573c9fb560ada92028478","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌超越摩西"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["同蒙天召的聖潔弟兄啊，你們應當思想我們所認為使者、為大祭司的耶穌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他為那設立他的盡忠，如同摩西在上帝的全家盡忠一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他比摩西算是更配多得榮耀，好像建造房屋的比房屋更尊榮；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為房屋都必有人建造，但建造萬物的就是上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["摩西為僕人，在上帝的全家誠然盡忠，為要證明將來必傳說的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但基督為兒子，治理上帝的家；我們若將可誇的盼望和膽量堅持到底，便是他的家了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝子民的安息"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["聖靈有話說：",{"text":"你們今日若聽他的話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就不可硬着心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在曠野惹他發怒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"試探他的時候一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裏，你們的祖宗試我探我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且觀看我的作為有四十年之久。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我厭煩那世代的人，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們心裏常常迷糊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟不曉得我的作為！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就在怒中起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們斷不可進入我的安息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["弟兄們，你們要謹慎，免得你們中間或有人存着不信的惡心，把永生上帝離棄了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["總要趁着還有今日，天天彼此相勸，免得你們中間有人被罪迷惑，心裏就剛硬了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我們若將起初確實的信心堅持到底，就在基督裏有分了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["經上說：「你們今日若聽他的話，就不可硬着心，像惹他發怒的日子一樣。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["那時，聽見他話惹他發怒的是誰呢？豈不是跟着摩西從埃及出來的眾人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["上帝四十年之久，又厭煩誰呢？豈不是那些犯罪、屍首倒在曠野的人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["又向誰起誓，不容他們進入他的安息呢？豈不是向那些不信從的人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["這樣看來，他們不能進入安息是因為不信的緣故了。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}